i/private/shk/agentCity/documentation/STDMAE_ADAPTATION_REPORT.md`\n\n**Description**: Comprehensive adaptation report including architecture, changes, configuration, and testing recommendations\n\n### 5. Test Script\n**File**: `/home/wangwenrui/private/shk/agentCity/test_stdmae_import.py`\n\n**Description**: Automated test suite for verifying STDMAE implementation\n\n**Tests Included**:\n- Import test\n- Components import test\n- Model initialization test\n- Forward pass test\n- Loss calculation test\n\n## Model Registration\n\n**File**: `/home/wangwenrui/private/shk/agentCity/Bigscity-LibCity/libcity/model/traffic_speed_prediction/__init__.py`\n\n**Status**: Already registered (line 40)\n```python\nfrom libcity.model.traffic_speed_prediction.STDMAE import STDMAE\n```\n\n**Status in __all__**: Already included (line 87)\n```python\n__all__ = [..., "STDMAE", ...]\n```\n\n## Required Dependencies\n\n### Python Packages\n1. **timm**: Vision transformer utilities\n   ```bash\n   pip install timm\n   ```\n\n2. **positional-encodings**: Positional encoding library\n   ```bash\n   pip install positional-encodings[pytorch]\n   ```\n\n### Built-in LibCity Dependencies\n- torch, torch.nn, torch.nn.functional\n- libcity.model.abstract_traffic_state_model\n- libcity.model.loss\n- numpy, scipy (for adjacency matrix processing)\n\n## Model Architecture Summary\n\n```\nSTD-MAE Architecture:\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ Input: [B, T, N, C]                         │\n└─────────────┬───────────────────────────────┘\n              │\n              ├──────────────┬─────────────────┐\n              │              │                 │\n              ▼              ▼                 │\n     ┌──────────────┐ ┌──────────────┐        │\n     │   T-MAE      │ │   S-MAE      │        │\n     │  (Temporal)  │ │  (Spatial)   │        │\n     └──────┬───────┘ └──────┬───────┘        │\n            │                │                 │\n            │ [B,N,P,96]     │ [B,N,P,96]     │\n            │                │                 │\n            └────────┬───────┘                 │\n                     │                         │\n                     ▼                         │\n            Concatenate [B,N,P,192]            │\n                     │                         │\n                     ▼                         │\n            Extract Last Patch                 │\n                 [B,N,192]                     │\n                     │                         │\n                     ▼                         │\n              ┌─────────────┐                  │\n              │ GraphWaveNet│◄─────────────────┘\n              │   Backend   │   (short history)\n              └──────┬──────┘\n                     │\n                     ▼\n           Output: [B, T_out, N, 1]\n```\n\n## Configuration for Different Datasets\n\n### METR-LA / PEMS-BAY\n```json\n{\n  "num_nodes": 207,  // or 325 for PEMS-BAY\n  "input_window": 12,\n  "output_window": 12,\n  "patch_size": 12,\n  "embed_dim": 96,\n  "encoder_depth": 4,\n  "blocks": 4,\n  "layers": 2,\n  "batch_size": 32,\n  "learning_rate": 0.0005\n}\n```\n\n### PEMS04 / PEMS08\n```json\n{\n  "num_nodes": 307,  // or 170 for PEMS08\n  "input_window": 12,\n  "output_window": 12,\n  "patch_size": 12,\n  "embed_dim": 96,\n  "encoder_depth": 4,\n  "blocks": 4,\n  "layers": 2,\n  "batch_size": 32,\n  "learning_rate": 0.0005\n}\n```\n\n## Pre-trained Checkpoints\n\n### Location in Original Repository\n```\n/home/wangwenrui/private/shk/agentCity/repos/STD-MAE/checkpoints/\n├── STDMAE_300/\n│   ├── PEMS03/\n│   ├── PEMS04/\n│   ├── PEMS07/\n│   ├── PEMS08/\n│   ├── PEMSD7L/\n│   └── PEMSD7M/\n└── STDMAE_100/\n    └── EXPY-TKY/\n```\n\n### Configuration for Using Checkpoints\n```json\n{\n  "pre_trained_tmae_path": "/path/to/T-MAE_checkpoint.pth",\n  "pre_trained_smae_path": "/path/to/S-MAE_checkpoint.pth"\n}\n```\n\n**Note**: If checkpoint paths are not provided or loading fails, the model will