| Number of layers per block |\n| `gcn_bool` | bool | true | Whether to use graph convolution |\n| `addaptadj` | bool | true | Whether to use adaptive adjacency matrix |\n| `kernel_size` | int | 2 | Temporal convolution kernel size |\n| `residual_channels` | int | 32 | Residual connection channels |\n| `dilation_channels` | int | 32 | Dilated convolution channels |\n| `skip_channels` | int | 256 | Skip connection channels |\n| `end_channels` | int | 512 | Final layer channels |\n\n**Notes**:\n- More `blocks` and `layers` increase model capacity but also memory usage\n- `skip_channels` and `end_channels` should be relatively large for good performance\n\n### Time Window Parameters\n\n| Parameter | Type | Default | Description |\n|-----------|------|---------|-------------|\n| `input_window` | int | 12 | Input sequence length |\n| `output_window` | int | 12 | Output sequence length |\n\n**Important**: `input_window` must be divisible by `patch_size`\n\n### Pre-trained Checkpoint Parameters\n\n| Parameter | Type | Default | Description |\n|-----------|------|---------|-------------|\n| `pre_trained_tmae_path` | str/null | null | Path to pre-trained T-MAE checkpoint |\n| `pre_trained_smae_path` | str/null | null | Path to pre-trained S-MAE checkpoint |\n\n**Notes**:\n- If null, model uses random initialization\n- Checkpoint files should contain \'model_state_dict\' key\n- Graceful fallback to random initialization if loading fails\n\n## Training Parameters\n\n| Parameter | Type | Default | Description |\n|-----------|------|---------|-------------|\n| `max_epoch` | int | 100 | Maximum training epochs |\n| `batch_size` | int | 32 | Batch size |\n| `learner` | str | "adam" | Optimizer type |\n| `learning_rate` | float | 0.0005 | Initial learning rate |\n| `lr_decay` | bool | true | Whether to use learning rate decay |\n| `lr_scheduler` | str | "multisteplr" | LR scheduler type |\n| `lr_decay_ratio` | float | 0.1 | LR decay ratio |\n| `milestones` | list[int] | [1,18,36,54