 "pre_trained_tmae_path": "/path/to/checkpoints/T-MAE_PEMS04.pth",\n  "pre_trained_smae_path": "/path/to/checkpoints/S-MAE_PEMS04.pth",\n\n  "batch_size": 32,\n  "max_epoch": 100,\n  "learner": "adam",\n  "learning_rate": 0.0005,\n  "lr_decay": true,\n  "lr_scheduler": "multisteplr",\n  "lr_decay_ratio": 0.1,\n  "milestones": [1, 18, 36, 54, 72],\n  "clip_grad_norm": true,\n  "max_grad_norm": 3.0,\n  "use_early_stop": true,\n  "patience": 10\n}\n```\n\n### Example 3: Lightweight Configuration (for testing)\n```json\n{\n  "model": "STDMAE",\n  "task": "traffic_state_pred",\n  "dataset": "METR_LA",\n\n  "input_window": 12,\n  "output_window": 12,\n\n  "patch_size": 12,\n  "embed_dim": 64,\n  "num_heads": 2,\n  "mlp_ratio": 2,\n  "dropout": 0.1,\n  "mask_ratio": 0.25,\n  "encoder_depth": 2,\n  "decoder_depth": 1,\n\n  "blocks": 2,\n  "layers": 1,\n  "gcn_bool": true,\n  "addaptadj": true,\n  "kernel_size": 2,\n  "residual_channels": 16,\n  "dilation_channels": 16,\n  "skip_channels": 128,\n  "end_channels": 256,\n\n  "pre_trained_tmae_path": null,\n  "pre_trained_smae_path": null,\n\n  "batch_size": 16,\n  "max_epoch": 50,\n  "learner": "adam",\n  "learning_rate": 0.001,\n  "lr_decay": false,\n  "clip_grad_norm": true,\n  "max_grad_norm": 5.0,\n  "use_early_stop": true,\n  "patience": 10\n}\n```\n\n## Parameter Tuning Guidelines\n\n### For Better Performance\n- Increase `embed_dim` (96 → 128 → 192)\n- Increase `encoder_depth` (4 → 6 → 8)\n- Increase `blocks` (4 → 6)\n- Increase `skip_channels` and `end_channels`\n\n### For Faster Training / Lower Memory\n- Decrease `embed_dim` (96 → 64 → 32)\n- Decrease `encoder_depth` (4 → 2)\n- Decrease `blocks` (4 → 2)\n- Decrease `batch_size` (32 → 16)\n- Decrease `skip_channels` and `end_channels`\n\n### For Different Input Lengths\n- If `input_window` = 24, set `patch_size` = 12 (2 patches) or 24 (1 patch)\n- If `input_window` = 36, set `patch_size` = 12 (3 patches)\n- Always ensure `input_window % patch_size == 0`\n\n## Common Issues and Solutions\n\n### Issue 1: Out of Memory\n**Solution**:\n- Reduce `batch_size`\n- Reduce `embed_dim`\n- Reduce `encoder_depth`\n- Reduce `blocks` or `layers`\n\n### Issue 2: Shape Mismatch Error\n**Solution**:\n- Ensure `input_window % patch_size == 0`\n- Check that `output_window` matches expected output\n\n### Issue 3: Poor Performance\n**Solution**:\n- Use pre-trained checkpoints if available\n- Increase `embed_dim` and `encoder_depth`\n- Tune learning rate (try 0.001, 0.0005, 0.0001)\n- Increase training epochs\n\n### Issue 4: Checkpoint Loading Failure\n**Solution**:\n- Verify checkpoint file path is correct\n- Check checkpoint file format (should contain \'model_state_dict\')\n- Model will continue with random initialization (check logs for warning)\n\n## Parameter Validation\n\nThe model performs automatic validation for:\n- ✅ `patch_size` > 0\n- ✅ `embed_dim` > 0\n- ✅ `num_heads` > 0\n- ✅ `encoder_depth` > 0\n- ✅ `blocks` > 0\n- ✅ `layers` > 0\n\nAdditional validation performed during runtime:\n- ✅ Input shape matches expected dimensions\n- ✅ Adjacency matrix matches number of nodes\n- ✅ Device compatibility\n\n## References\n\n- Original Paper: "Spatial-Temporal Dual Masked Autoencoders for Forecasting"\n- LibCity Documentation: https://bigscity-libcity-docs.readthedocs.io/\n- Configuration File: `/Bigscity-LibCity/libcity/config/model/traffic_state_pred/STDMAE.json`\n\n---\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-24\n'}
